You applied.

silence-nothing
00:00:03.733 --> 00:00:04.767
Then… nothing.

pile
00:00:06.933 --> 00:00:10.600
Recruiters? Buried in PDFs, inboxes and tabs.

reveal-meet
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:13.133
Meet Callback.

reveal-tagline
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.900
Because every application deserves a response.

candidates-search
00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:19.900
For candidates: apply to companies hiring on Callback.

candidates-apply
00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:22.267
Apply with the CV you already have.

candidates-track
00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:26.567
Your status updates itself. No more guessing.

employers-post
